          3,
          7,
          8
        ]
      },
      {
        "claim": "Shots, not goals, are the right measure of teamwork, and a handful of metrics track them.",
        "support_steps": [
          "cite the set-piece share",
          "reject pace as uninformative",
          "regress the wide set",
          "keep six"
        ],
        "decision_consequence": "Using goals would have credited individual skill to the team.",
        "source_pages": [
          6,
          7,
          8,
          9
        ]
      },
      {
        "claim": "The right style depends on the opponent, and the choice depends on whether a win, a draw or survival is needed.",
